  "result": "Subcommands now pick up their own `default_map` entries.\n\nIn `src/click/core.py`, a child `Context` was inheriting the parent's whole `default_map`. So a subcommand looked up its options in the group-level dict instead of its own entry. It now takes `parent.default_map.get(info_name)`, so `default_map={\"sub\": {\"port\": 5000}}` applies to `sub`.\n\nI added a regression test, `test_default_map_subcommand` in `tests/test_defaults.py`. The full suite passes (1906 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed).\n\nI didn't update `CHANGES.md`.",
